# Curative Module

> Manage, track, and resolve title defects to prepare acquisitions for successful closing.

---

# Overview

The Curative module manages the legal and operational process of resolving title defects identified during Title Review.

Curative work ensures ownership is legally verified, documentation is complete, and all issues preventing a transaction from closing have been resolved.

Every Curative Item is linked to a Deal, Asset, Owner, and Title Review, providing complete visibility into outstanding legal requirements.

---

# Objectives

The Curative module enables users to:

- Track title defects
- Assign curative tasks
- Collect missing legal documents
- Monitor completion status
- Coordinate with owners and attorneys
- Prepare title for closing
- Maintain legal audit history

