# Business Rules

## Rule 1

Every Curative Item must originate from a Title Review finding.

---

## Rule 2

Critical Curative Items block Closing.

---

## Rule 3

Completed Curative Items require legal approval.

---

## Rule 4

All uploaded documents are linked to the Curative Item.

---

## Rule 5

Every status change is recorded in the audit log.

